  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper introduces a classical real‑time quantum Monte Carlo (QMC) algorithm for simulating noisy gate‑based quantum circuits. Benchmarks show order‑of‑magnitude speedups over quantum trajectory (QT) simulation, e.g., >10× improvement for |+⟩ⁿ circuits and ~100× for W‑state circuits, enabling classical simulations up to 30 qubits compared with ~16 qubits for QT on the same hardware (16‑core AMD EPYC 7542 with 64 GB RAM).",
  "experiments": [
